                &lt;div&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/releases/tag/3.1.0"&gt;3.1.0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;What's Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3.1 - Client-side geographic failover by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4028690676" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3025" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3025/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3025"&gt;#3025&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a major feature, with &lt;a href="https://stackexchange.github.io/StackExchange.Redis/Failover" rel="nofollow"&gt;extensive documentation&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Note that it currently has an &lt;code&gt;[Experimental]&lt;/code&gt; marker, &lt;a href="https://stackexchange.github.io/StackExchange.Redis/exp/SER007" rel="nofollow"&gt;linking here&lt;/a&gt;, but: this is purely for an abundance of caution; it is considered released and fully supported.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;(engineering)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CI: stop dpkg starting redis-server (Windows/WSL install hang on 8.10) by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5017917494" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3145" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3145/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3145"&gt;#3145&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make the previous "we will remove this in 3.0" features &lt;em&gt;errors&lt;/em&gt; rather than warnings, and reframe as "...in 3.2"&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;available on &lt;a href="https://www.nuget.org/packages/StackExchange.Redis/3.1.0" rel="nofollow"&gt;NuGet&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full Changelog&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;a class="commit-link" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/compare/3.0.25...3.1.0"&gt;&lt;tt&gt;3.0.25...3.1.0&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
